# Pairs with NoForeignOverwrite. A finished publish releases every claim of
# its scope rather than its own. A second publish of the same scope, still
# waiting on its hold through a retire, is left without a claim, and another
# scope takes the id from under it (#5627).
MODULE: NoForeignOverwriteReleaseClearsAll
TARGET: NoForeignOverwrite
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a release drops every claim of the scope, not one
PERTURBS: PubRow

--- FIND
       /\ pend' = [pend EXCEPT ![s] = IF @ > 0 THEN @ - 1 ELSE 0]
--- REPLACE
       \* MUTATION: every claim of the scope is released.
       /\ pend' = [pend EXCEPT ![s] = 0]
--- END
